There's an interesting trade-off.  For characters who can reach Expert
in dagger there is incentive to get Sting ASAP.  For characters who
want to collect as many artifacts as possible in their final golf bag
there's incentive to avoid Sting and Orcrist until you've given up on
using sacrafices.  Then Sunsword, Demonbane, Magicbane, Sting
and Orcrist can be gotten.  Although the danger levels involved in
S/D are greater than with S/O and the danger level involved in M is
so high I can't imagine anyone going for it that way - purple L's come
with it 5% of the time so it takes facing nearly all 120 to get really
high odds.  The farthest I've gotten on that route was S/D from A's.



